==Scottish Gaelic==

===Adverb===
'''ann'''

# [[there]]
#* A bheil thu '''ann'''?, ''Are you there?''

===Preposition===
'''ann'''

# [[in]], [[within]]
#* '''ann''' an tigh, ''in a house''
#* '''ann''' am baile, ''in a town''
# [[there]], [[therein]]
# in existence, [[alive]]

===Pronoun===
'''ann'''

# in him
#* Chan eil coire 'sam bith '''ann.''', ''There is no fault in him at all.''
#* Chan eil '''ann''' ach crochair., ''He is but a rascal.''
# in it

